# [DNSSD](../wg/dnssd.html)

## Summary

The DNS-SD Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered updates on active working group documents—including Unicast Local Discovery (ULD), Multicast DNS conflict resolution using Time Since Received (TSR), and Advertising Proxy—as well as discussions on SNAC topology complexity, DNS message signatures (DNS MSGSIG), and non-IP DNS-SD service discovery via the DNS-SD Data Block format.

The working group agreed to target Working Group Last Call (WGLC) for `draft-ietf-dnssd-tsr` in the near term following minor text refinements and scope adjustments.

