## Decisions and Action Items

1. **`draft-ietf-dnssd-tsr` Updates & WGLC:**
   - Add a 32-bit SRP update hash field into the TSR option.
   - Update document title and abstract to reflect multi-advertiser operational scope.
   - Clarify BCP 14 MUST/SHOULD requirements and exception cases.
   - Proceed to Working Group Last Call (WGLC) within the month once edits are posted.

2. **`draft-ietf-dnssd-uld` Conflict Handling:**
   - Incorporate per-name conflict reporting status for both SRP zone updates and asynchronous mDNS probing.
   - Document DSO connection handling to prevent premature idle disconnects during active SRP registrations.

3. **`draft-ietf-dnssd-advertising-proxy` TTL Settings:**
   - Update proxy address record TTL recommendations to 75 minutes to minimize multicast polling overhead.

